  "notes": "FORMS:\n{観|かん} (view, watch) + {覧|らん} (look at, see) → watch and view\n{観覧|かんらん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to view, to watch)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{観覧車|かんらんしゃ}→観覧車：09221_kanransha⟧ (Ferris wheel - literally \"viewing wheel\")\n- {観覧料|かんらんりょう} (admission fee)\n- {観覧席|かんらんせき} (spectator seats)\n- ⟦{一般|いっぱん}→一般：01737_ippan⟧{観覧|かんらん} (public viewing/admission)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{鑑賞|かんしょう}→鑑賞：14516_kanshou⟧ (appreciation, viewing - for art/music)\n- ⟦{見学|けんがく}→見学：00214_kengaku⟧ (observation visit, tour)\n- ⟦{観戦|かんせん}→観戦：14142_kansen⟧ (watching a game/match)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{観覧|かんらん} is a general term for viewing. ⟦{鑑賞|かんしょう}→鑑賞：14516_kanshou⟧ implies appreciation with deeper engagement (art, music). ⟦{見学|けんがく}→見学：00214_kengaku⟧ implies a learning or educational purpose. ⟦{観戦|かんせん}→観戦：14142_kansen⟧ is specifically for sports.",
